<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier</p>
<p>league soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Chelsea 3 (Hughes 6, 35, Zola 10) West Ham 1 (Porfirio 11).</p>
<p>Halftime 3-1. Attendance 28,315.</p>
<p>Everton 0 Leeds 0. 36,954.</p>
<p>Leicester 0 Coventry 2 (Dublin 12, 72). 0-1. 20,038.</p>
<p>Manchester United 5 (Solskjaer 35, 48, Cantona 43 pen, 80, Butt</p>
<p>59) Sunderland 0. 2-0. 55,081.</p>
<p>Nottingham Forest 2 (Haaland 67, 89) Arsenal 1 (Wright 63).</p>
<p>0-0. 27,384.</p>
<p>Southampton 3 (Watson 9, Oakley 13, Magilton 89 pen) Derby 1</p>
<p>(Dailly 8). 2-1. 14,901.</p>
<p>Tottenham 1 (Nielsen 29) Sheffield Wednesday 1 (Nolan 16). 1-1.</p>
<p>30,996.</p>
